# RunicAI Context Engineering

```elixir
Mix.install([
  {:runic_ai, path: ".."}
])
```

Context engineering keeps transcript truth separate from derived working
context.

```mermaid
flowchart LR
  transcript[Conversation transcript] --> graph[Context graph]
  graph --> focus[Focus]
  focus --> memory[Memory recall]
  focus --> retrieval[Retrieval]
  memory --> bundle[Context bundle]
  retrieval --> bundle
  graph --> pressure[Window pressure]
  pressure --> compaction[Compaction]
  compaction --> bundle
  bundle --> prompt[Prompt]
```

```elixir
alias RunicAI.Context.Focus

Focus.new!(
  goal: "Resolve the user's deployment issue",
  entities: ["release", "assets", "database"],
  constraints: ["Keep the response concise"]
)
```
